{
  "id": "EZR.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "EZR",
  "reference": "Ezra 10",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 44,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZR 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The People's Confession of Sin",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "While Ezra was praying and confessing, weeping and throwing himself down before the house of God, a large crowd of Israelites—men, women and children—gathered around him. They too wept bitterly.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Shekaniah son of Jehiel, one of the descendants of Elam, said to Ezra, \"We have been unfaithful to our God by marrying foreign women from the peoples around us. But in spite of this, there is still hope for Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now let us make a covenant before our God to send away all these women and their children, in accordance with the counsel of my lord and of those who fear the commands of our God. Let it be done according to the Law.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rise up; this matter is in your hands. We will support you, so take courage and do it.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Ezra rose up and put the leading priests and Levites and all Israel under oath to do what had been suggested. And they took the oath.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Ezra withdrew from before the house of God and went to the room of Jehohanan son of Eliashib. While he was there, he ate no food and drank no water, because he continued to mourn over the unfaithfulness of the exiles.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A proclamation was then issued throughout Judah and Jerusalem for all the exiles to assemble in Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyone who failed to appear within three days would forfeit all his property, in accordance with the decision of the officials and elders, and would himself be expelled from the assembly of the exiles.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Within the three days, all the men of Judah and Benjamin had gathered in Jerusalem. And on the twentieth day of the ninth month, all the people were sitting in the square before the house of God, greatly distressed by the occasion and because of the rain.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Ezra the priest stood up and said to them, \"You have been unfaithful; you have married foreign women, adding to Israel's guilt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now honor",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZR.10.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZR.10.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of your ancestors, and do his will. Separate yourselves from the peoples around you and from your foreign wives.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The whole assembly responded with a loud voice: \"You are right! We must do as you say.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But there are many people here and it is the rainy season; so we cannot stand outside. Besides, this matter cannot be taken care of in a day or two, because we have sinned greatly in this thing.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let our officials act for the whole assembly. Then let everyone in our towns who has married a foreign woman come at a set time, along with the elders and judges of each town, until the fierce anger of our God in this matter is turned away from us.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Only Jonathan son of Asahel and Jahzeiah son of Tikvah, supported by Meshullam and Shabbethai the Levite, opposed this.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the exiles did as was proposed. Ezra the priest selected men who were family heads, one from each family division, and all of them designated by name. On the first day of the tenth month they sat down to investigate the cases,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and by the first day of the first month they finished dealing with all the men who had married foreign women.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Those Guilty of Intermarriage",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lh"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Among the descendants of the priests, the following had married foreign women:",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "EZR 10:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "From the descendants of Joshua son of Jozadak, and his brothers:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "EZR 10:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Maaseiah, Eliezer, Jarib and Gedaliah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(They all gave their hands in pledge to put away their wives, and for their guilt they each presented a ram from the flock as a guilt offering.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From the descendants of Immer:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "EZR 10:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hanani and Zebadiah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From the descendants of Harim:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "EZR 10:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Maaseiah, Elijah, Shemaiah, Jehiel and Uzziah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From the descendants of Pashhur:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "EZR 10:22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elioenai, Maaseiah, Ishmael, Nethanel, Jozabad and Elasah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lh"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Among the Levites:",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "EZR 10:23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jozabad, Shimei, Kelaiah (that is, Kelita), Pethahiah, Judah and Eliezer.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From the musicians:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "EZR 10:24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eliashib.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "EZR 10:24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "From the gatekeepers:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "EZR 10:24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shallum, Telem and Uri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lh"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And among the other Israelites:",
          "type": "text"
